RPS5E
-----
https://github.com/ (RPS5E, GPL-2.0)

The SaveData mount-mode semantics in pkg/runtime/modules/libSceSaveData/ps4_savedata.c (CREATE fails when the save exists,
CREATE2 is create-or-open, a plain open mode on a missing save is NOT_FOUND, a mode naming nothing is a parameter error) follow
RPS5E's ps5hle/src/savedata.rs (mount()). GPL-2.0, compatible with this project's GPL-2.0-only.

