upstream's, unchanged.

KytyPS5 and the AstroHybrid bridge
----------------------------------
https://github.com/Jetsku/KytyPS5 (GPL-2.0; original Kyty MIT) and the AstroHybrid kyty-hybrid patch series,
https://github.com/imnotsharingmyname/pcportastrobot, folder Source/kyty-hybrid (a derivative of KytyPS5, used
under GPL-2.0). pkg/runtime/modules/libSceAnyPS5/kytyGpuApi.h is the bridge interface of that series (ABI 1.0-1.5,
extended here to 1.7), pkg/thunkgen/kyty_nids.tsv restates its table of the 84 graphics exports, and
nps5_kyty*.c is the host side written for this runtime (docs/m3/kyty-seam.md). The idea of running Kyty's
renderer inside a natively translated program is AstroHybrid's; credit for it belongs to its author.

AnyPS5
------
https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5, GPL-2.0. pkg/runtime/modules/libSceAnyPS5 and pkg/thunkgen/anyps5.go call
the exports of AnyPS5's host libraries with the prototypes AnyPS5 declares (signatures restated by
tools/anyps5_sigs.py). No AnyPS5 source file is included.

